          {
            "content": "CURRENT REFLECTIONS:\n(none yet)\n\nCURRENT OBSERVATIONS:\n[1c31f2cdb6bb] <local-time> [high] [coverage: none] User asked to store uploads in S3.\n[ca54c645c783] <local-time> [low] [coverage: none] Assistant agreed to use S3.\n\nCrystallize any missing durable facts or patterns into new reflections. If nothing is stable enough, do not call the tool.",
