            "content": "CURRENT REFLECTIONS:\n[2ae70fdfa553] Uploads live in S3.\n\nCURRENT OBSERVATIONS:\n[1c31f2cdb6bb] <local-time> [high] [coverage: partial] User asked to store uploads in S3.\n[ca54c645c783] <local-time> [low] [coverage: none] Assistant agreed to use S3.\n\nActive observation pool: ~36 tokens; target: ~1 tokens; fullness against target: ~3600%; over target by ~35 tokens.\nMaximum drops allowed this run: 2 observation(s). This maximum is sized to move the active pool toward the target if every proposed drop is clearly safe.\nThis maximum is a hard upper bound, not a target. Drop fewer or none if fewer observations are clearly safe.",
